<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Bagi maksud suatu projek pembaharuan semula bandar di Wilayah-Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur, Putrajaya dan Labuan, Menteri Wilayah Persekutuan boleh, melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta, mengisytiharkan mana-mana kawasan sebagai suatu kawasan pembaharuan semula bandar."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Bagi maksud suatu projek pembaharuan semula bandar di Negeri, Pihak Berkuasa Negeri boleh, melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta Negeri, mengisytiharkan mana-mana kawasan sebagai suatu kawasan pembaharuan semula bandar."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Bagi maksud suatu projek pembaharuan semula bandar di Negeri yang dijalankan oleh Jawatankuasa Eksekutif Persekutuan, Menteri boleh, melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta, mengisytiharkan mana-mana kawasan sebagai suatu kawasan pembaharuan semula bandar."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Tertakluk kepada seksyen 19, apabila suatu kawasan diisytiharkan sebagai kawasan pembaharuan semula bandar, pemaju diluluskan hendaklah memindah milik atau mengambil milik mana-mana tanah diberi hakmilik yang terletak di dalam kawasan pembaharuan semula bandar melalui pembelian atau pengambilan paksa di bawah Akta Pengambilan Tanah 1960 [Akta 486]."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Apabila perisytiharan suatu kawasan sebagai kawasan pembaharuan semula bandar di bawah subseksyen (1), (2) atau (3), pemaju diluluskan hendaklah memulakan projek pembaharuan semula bandar dalam tempoh dua puluh empat bulan dari tarikh perisytiharan itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Pemaju diluluskan boleh membuat suatu permohonan bagi pelanjutan masa bagi tempoh dua puluh empat bulan yang disebut dalam subseksyen (5) kepada Jawatankuasa Eksekutif Persekutuan atau Jawatankuasa Eksekutif Negeri, mengikut mana-mana yang berkenaan, mengikut cara sebagaimana yang ditetapkan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "7" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Jawatankuasa Eksekutif Persekutuan atau Jawatankuasa Eksekutif Negeri boleh melanjutkan tempoh yang disebut dalam subseksyen (5) sebagaimana yang difikirkannya patut dan sesuai. Penggal 2 Penyegaran semula bandar Ketidakpakaian Bahagian atau Penggal"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_22> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_22> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "22" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_22> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "Peruntukan Bahagian II, Penggal I Bahagian III dan Bahagian IV tidak terpakai bagi projek penyegaran semula bandar. Projek penyegaran semula bandar"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "23" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Bagi maksud suatu projek penyegaran semula bandar, pihak berkuasa tempatan boleh menyampaikan suatu notis niat bagi pemulaan projek penyegaran semula bandar kepada mana-mana orang yang berkepentingan sebagaimana yang difikirkan suai manfaat oleh pihak berkuasa tempatan untuk menjalankan suatu projek penyegaran semula bandar."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Apabila notis niat bagi pemulaan projek penyegaran semula bandar di bawah subseksyen (1) diterima, orang yang berkepentingan boleh hadir bagi perundingan dengan pihak berkuasa tempatan dalam tempoh masa sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam notis niat bagi pemulaan projek penyegaran semula bandar itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Selepas perundingan yang disebut dalam subseksyen (2) dimuktamadkan, orang yang berkepentingan itu boleh bersetuju atau enggan bersetuju dengan pemulaan projek penyegaran semula bandar itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Pihak berkuasa tempatan tidak boleh menjalankan suatu projek penyegaran semula bandar tanpa persetujuan orang yang berkepentingan itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@/~part_III__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/msa@> .
